  "title": "Barbecue Beef Cups",
  "description": "Make BBQ beef cups with refrigerated biscuits formed into cups to fill with barbecue beef, then top with cheese. These make a great snack or appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
